PROS_CLS_CODE^처리구분코드^1^0^0^0^0^0^0
ACNO^계좌번호^8^0^0^0^0^0^0

				</TRBLOCK>
				<TRBLOCK name="InBlock2" occurs="500" inout="in" _len="105" _ulen="79" >

ZI_HGRN_ATRB_CODE^제로인상위속성코드^4^0^0^0^0^0^0
